<title>UK: BA slips on strike vote, alliance report.</title>
<headline>BA slips on strike vote, alliance report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Airways Plc edged lower on Wednesday, hit by a looming series of strikes and a report that the UK government had failed to settle disagreements over its alliance with American Airlines.</p>
</text>
